<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink166-kilavi">
       notumalar varaivuvēṇṭi viṭuttamaiyaṟinta talaimakaḷ āṟṟāḷāyp paciyaṭaniṟpuḻi, itaṟkuk kāraṇameṉ eṉṟu cevili viṉavat tōḻi aṟattoṭu niṉṟatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
           The confidante revealing the truth when the foster mother asked, 'what is the cause of this', when the heroin who learned of [his] letting go [of her], [he] having learned of [her family's] wanting [her] to marry a stranger, was staying hungry as one who could not bear [the separation].</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink168">
<l>peruṅkaṭaṟ karaiyatu ciṟuveṇ kākkai</l>
<l>tuṟaipaṭi yampi yakamaṇai yīṉun</l>
<l>taṇṇan tuṟaiva ṉalki</l>
<l>ṉoṇṇuta larivai pālā rummē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>If the man of the soft, pretty shores </l>
        <l>In which the small, white crow of the vast seashore</l>
        <l>Lays eggs on the wooden planks inside a small boat that settles on the shore</l>
        <l>Grants [his love], </l>
        <l>The girl with a bright forehead will be full with [the colour of] milk.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
